      ],
      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Because consciousness likely depends on being alive, not on computation, AI probably cannot become conscious, though it can seem so, and that illusion is the real danger.",
      "question": "Conscious AI — can machines ever truly become conscious, and why does the answer matter? (an argued case)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
