      "title": "Introduction",
      "gist": "Cultural fears about artificial minds are resurfacing as AI improves, raising urgent questions about whether machines can be conscious and why that would matter morally and personally.",
      "question": "Machine consciousness — why does whether AI is conscious matter so much? (a set of stakes)"
    },
