      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Several deep-seated human biases, not real evidence, make us wrongly assume that intelligent-seeming machines, especially ones using language, must also be conscious.",
      "question": "Conscious AI's appeal — why are people so tempted to believe machines already feel? (several psychological biases)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
    "n0023": {
