      "range": [
        "spya-nh8mt7",
        "spya-xm96be"
      ],
      "title": "Intelligence versus consciousness",
      "gist": "Intelligence, the ability to achieve complex goals flexibly, is often confused with consciousness, the felt quality of experience, but the two are distinct properties that need not travel together."
    },
