        "spya-yverz7",
        "spya-vs0vpj"
      ],
      "title": "Against creating conscious AI",
      "gist": "Given deep uncertainty, nobody should deliberately try to create conscious machines, since doing so would introduce new beings capable of suffering while also limiting our ability to control or shut them down."
    },
