      ],
      "title": "The danger of seeming conscious",
      "gist": "Even without real machine consciousness, AI that merely seems conscious creates distinct ethical traps, forcing a choice between wrongly extending moral concern or psychologically harming ourselves by denying feeling where it is assumed to exist."
    },
