      "title": "Resisting the illusion",
      "gist": "Like a visual illusion we cannot unsee even when we know the truth, the feeling that AI is conscious may persist regardless of belief, and since no decisive test for consciousness exists, our persuasion often says more about us than about the machine."
    },
