      "range": [
        "spya-d89xf7",
        "spya-d89xf7"
      ],
      "title": "Avoiding both errors",
      "gist": "While history warns us against wrongly denying moral status to beings that deserve it, our biases toward AI likely run the opposite way, making false positives, not false negatives, the greater risk here."
    },
    "n0155": {
