        "n0164"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-v98v5u",
        "spya-w8z40d"
      ],
      "title": "Soul Machine",
      "gist": "Rather than chasing a disembodied, machine-made notion of mind, we should recognize that our value and inner life come from being living, embodied, biological creatures, not from information processing.",
      "question": "AI and the soul — what should conscious AI mythology teach us about ourselves? (a closing reflection)",
      "sourceHeading": "Soul Machine"
    },
    "n0157": {
      "id": "n0157",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0156",
      "children": [
        "n0158",
        "n0159",
        "n0160"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-v98v5u",
        "spya-qwvjwn"
      ],
      "title": "Urgency of clear thinking",
      "gist": "As AI reshapes society and public perception shifts quickly, clear thinking about the real prospects and dangers of conscious AI, rather than either inevitability or impossibility, is urgent and valuable now."
    },
