      ],
      "title": "Reclaiming the soul",
      "gist": "Rejecting both the modern dismissal of the soul and the Cartesian fantasy of mind uploaded into eternal silicon, older traditions suggest our innermost essence is simply the felt sense of being alive, embodied, and breathing."
    },
